# The all-in-one machine's schedule, run by supercronic (deploy/README.md).
# Times are UTC. supercronic never starts a job while its previous run is
# still going, so two ticks cannot overlap.
#
# This file is a template. The entrypoint renders it at boot, replacing
# @TICK_SCHEDULE@ with the TICK_SCHEDULE environment variable (default
# "0 * * * *", hourly). The accelerated staging world (#129) sets
# "*/5 * * * *"; its clock moves on its own. Only the cadence comes from the
# environment; which clock runs is still the settings module's choice.

# The tick: world/README.md, "Deployment requirement".
@TICK_SCHEDULE@ /app/deploy/tick.sh

# Nightly off-box backup of the database and the race logs.
30 3 * * * cd /app && python -m deploy.backup
